{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-skip-skip-skip","version":1,"title":"Skip, Skip, Skip (a skipping rhyme)","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Turn the rope; turn it round.\nJump when it touches the ground!","sentences":["Turn the rope; turn it round.","Jump when it touches the ground!"],"alt":"Two children turn a rope while a third waits to jump.","image":{"hash":"sha256:9679916727a8c1bbda36b3d079baff6e06338b2c4f44bfc11c50a91ec1fd7607","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d10300d4a182c694820a0f924c39cf801469ecd9b64d618ad63025482323784a","durationMs":5920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3213],[3213,5920]],"words":[[0,338],[338,592],[592,1353],[1353,1691],[1691,1860],[1860,3213],[3213,3551],[3551,3889],[3889,4058],[4058,4650],[4650,4904],[4904,5920]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"One, two, three, four, five—\nwe keep on jumping, bright and alive!","sentences":["One, two, three, four, five—\nwe keep on jumping, bright and alive!"],"alt":"A child jumping as others count.","image":{"hash":"sha256:89004ee16c3c177883fbbdf8eb26d602d65bae7df7ce83d39fa9fe001cce8b61","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e02e35256f8bd069ddfac0881205e5d2268053e0a18dc8c10662bd332743ccc0","durationMs":9440,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9440]],"words":[[0,899],[899,1798],[1798,2922],[2922,3933],[3933,4944],[4944,5169],[5169,5619],[5619,5844],[5844,7193],[7193,7867],[7867,8204],[8204,9440]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Oh no! The rope has caught my toe.\nThat is all right—I try, and off I go!","sentences":["Oh no!","The rope has caught my toe.","That is all right—I try, and off I go!"],"alt":"A child whose foot caught in the rope, smiling.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b623fd65488ab7a3a7728c00193c81e0bca2951745ccd29cce4fc31e31f3ffdc","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:eba18ef73e6cfbcf6167b9a0be72e26048e617380c972f4dbd8